@dgBaseUrl = https://dg-sandbox.setu.co

1. KYC Client Credentials (PAN Verification, BAV/Penny Drop)

@kycClientId = {{$dotenv SETU_KYC_CLIENT_ID}}
@kycClientSecret = {{$dotenv SETU_KYC_CLIENT_SECRET}}
@panInstanceId = {{$dotenv SETU_PAN_INSTANCE_ID}}
@bavInstanceId = {{$dotenv SETU_BAV_INSTANCE_ID}}

2. Aadhaar eSign Client Credentials

@esignClientId = {{$dotenv SETU_ESIGN_CLIENT_ID}}
@esignClientSecret = {{$dotenv SETU_ESIGN_CLIENT_SECRET}}
@esignInstanceId = {{$dotenv SETU_ESIGN_INSTANCE_ID}}

3. Account Aggregator OAuth Client Credentials

@aaAuthUrl = https://orgservice-sandbox.setu.co/v1/users/login
@aaClientId = {{$dotenv SETU_AA_CLIENT_ID}}
@aaClientSecret = {{$dotenv SETU_AA_CLIENT_SECRET}}

1. Account Aggregator Step 1: Exchange M2M Client Credentials for JWT Bearer Token

@name generateAAToken

POST {{aaAuthUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
client: bridge

{
"clientID": "{{aaClientId}}",
"grant_type": "client_credentials",
"secret": "{{aaClientSecret}}"
}

2. Test PAN Verification (Sandbox Data Gateway via Standard KYC Credentials)

POST {{dgBaseUrl}}/api/verify/pan
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{kycClientId}}
x-client-secret: {{kycClientSecret}}
x-product-instance-id: {{panInstanceId}}

{
"pan": "ABCDE1234A",
"consent": "Y",
"reason": "Identity verification for OptiRate Loan Application"
}

3. Test Bank Account Penny Drop (Sandbox Data Gateway via Standard KYC Credentials)

POST {{dgBaseUrl}}/api/verify/ban
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: {{kycClientId}}
x-client-secret: {{kycClientSecret}}
x-product-instance-id: {{bavInstanceId}}

{
"accountNumber": "123456789012",
"ifsc": "HDFC0000123"
}

4. Aadhaar eSign: check a signature request created by the application

Note: uses eSign segregated Client ID, secret, and instance ID!

GET {{dgBaseUrl}}/api/signature/{{$dotenv SETU_ESIGN_REQUEST_ID}}
x-client-id: {{esignClientId}}
x-client-secret: {{esignClientSecret}}
x-product-instance-id: {{esignInstanceId}}
